%% Follow-up work flowchart (Mermaid)
%% File: docs/09-diagrams/follow-up-work.mmd

flowchart TD
  A[Follow-up Work] --> B(Collect required diagrams)
  B --> C{Decide priority}
  C -->|High| D[System architecture]
  C -->|Medium| E[Feature & event flows]
  C -->|Low| F[Operational runbooks / runbooks diagrams]
  D --> G[Draft mermaid files in docs/09-diagrams]
  E --> G
  F --> G
  G --> H[Peer review]
  H --> I[Publish to docs and link from README]
  I --> J[Close follow-up tasks]

  style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style D fill:#ffefc2,stroke:#333
  style E fill:#c2f0ff,stroke:#333
  style F fill:#e6e6e6,stroke:#333
  style H fill:#c2ffc2,stroke:#333
  style I fill:#d9d9ff,stroke:#333

